+// only searches the main bundle, so load from the framework bundle instead: in the one-game
+// app that is the app bundle itself, in the shell it is the game's framework bundle. Each
+// image is drawn at 4x point size so it stays sharp on 3x Retina. The artwork fills only
+// `fill` of its canvas, so the layer frame is the button's bounding box grown by 1/fill and
+// the artwork lands exactly on the geometry. The icons never change on press; only the left
